@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBorderColor #555555
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B39B4D
hide circle
hide empty members
left to right direction
title 第五週 teacher：一個 MissionLog 做全部的事

class MissionLog #FFE8D6 {
  + {static} main(args : String[]) : void
  ~ {static} runMission(script : int[], energy : int, samples : int) : void
  ~ {static} countCommands(history : ArrayList<MissionStep>) : int[]
  ~ {static} printReplay(history : ArrayList<MissionStep>) : void
  ~ {static} printSummary(scriptLength : int, history : ArrayList<MissionStep>) : void
  ~ {static} calculateBatteryPercent(energy : int) : double
}
class MissionStep #DFF3E3 {
  - command : int
  - energy : int
  - result : String
  + MissionStep(command : int, energy : int, result : String)
  + getCommand() : int
  + getEnergy() : int
  + getResult() : String
  + isSuccessful() : boolean
}
MissionLog ..> MissionStep : 區域變數 history\n建立並讀取
note bottom of MissionLog
  runMission 的區域變數：
  energy、samples、actionCount、running、history
  行動規則寫在 switch 裡
end note
@enduml
